{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2023-01-25 11:21:00', 'title': 'COMED OFFERING $500,000 IN GRANT FUNDING FOR COMMUNITY-ORIENTED PROJECTS ACROSS NORTHERN ILLINOIS', 'text': 'CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--COMED TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MUNICIPAL AND COMMUNITY ORGANIZATIONS IN NORTHERN ILLINOIS CAN NOW APPLY FOR THE 2023 POWERING COMMUNITIES GRANTS PROGRAM, WHICH ADVANCES ENVIRONMENTAL INITIATIVES, ENHANCES PUBLIC SAFETY AND INCREASES ACCESS TO ARTS PROGRAMS IN COMMUNITIES COMED SERVES. ORGANIZATIONS ARE ENCOURAGED TO APPLY FOR ONE OF THE THREE ANNUAL GRANT PROGRAMS: GREEN REGION, POWERING SAFE COMMUNITIES, AND POWERING THE ARTS. QUALIFYING PROPOSALS ARE ELIGIBLE FOR GRANTS OF UP TO $10,000 EACH.'}